<title>UK: Crelan Overseas sets 2.0 bln Luxfr step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Crelan Overseas sets 2.0 bln Luxfr step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bacob.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CRELAN OVERSEAS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CREDIT AGRICOLE BELGIUM</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON   **4.375     MATURITY    14.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  102.375   PAY DATE 13/14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> YIELD	5.35 PCT  DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	**UNTIL 14.MAR.01, THEN STEPS UP TO 7.375 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
